  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic Development Investment in Indonesia (Prospera)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia&apos;s economic partnership with Indonesia is a crucial element of the bilateral relationship. Economic governance development programming supports this partnership by creating opportunities for policy dialogue on key economic issues and, in the long-term, strengthening Indonesia&apos;s policy, budgeting and regulatory environment. This in turn increases Australia&apos;s influence and strengthen the conditions to allow greater trade and investment. The implementation of this new investment will sustain our cooperation in economic development in Indonesia, ensure the continuity of our assistance to strategic economic reforms and support the Indonesian Government to ensure that Indonesia&apos;s adjustment delivers its 2045 aspiration.</narrative>
  </description>
